  "bio": "\"Daniel the Gardener\" is a uniquely sculptural tattoo studio situated in the creative heart of London, UK. Known for its flourishing floral and striking black&gray designs, its high-quality artwork has gained a strong following of over 60k on Instagram. With books reopening for 2024, they have masterfully cultivated a reputation and atmosphere as unique and inviting as a gardener's dream."
